
## DDEV

- DDEV runs PHP, the database and Composer in the project's containers; mise installs DDEV itself, so CI and every machine run the same gates. Docker is the only host prerequisite.
- `mise run setup` starts DDEV and installs the committed `composer.lock`; `mise run dev` starts it. `.ddev/config.yaml` is seeded for the project to adapt; `.ddev/config.local.yaml` is for one machine and never committed.
